{"name":"智小游","templateConfig":{"accessControl":0,"agentComponentConfigList":[{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"contextRounds":3,"maxTokens":128000,"mode":"Balanced","temperature":1.0,"topP":0.7},"created":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","deleted":false,"description":"deepseek-flash","exceptionOut":0,"id":357314,"modified":"2026-09-18 11:08:11","name":"DeepSeek-V4-Flash","spaceId":53260111,"targetId":-1,"tenantId":1,"type":"Model"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"variables":[{"dataType":"String","description":"平台用户ID","enable":true,"name":"SYS_USER_ID","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"用户唯一标识","enable":true,"name":"USER_UID","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"用户语言环境","enable":true,"name":"USER_LANG","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"用户名称","enable":true,"name":"USER_NAME","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"智能体唯一标识","enable":true,"name":"AGENT_ID","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"会话唯一标识","enable":true,"name":"CONVERSATION_ID","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"请求唯一标识","enable":true,"name":"REQUEST_ID","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"用户消息","enable":true,"name":"AGENT_USER_MSG","require":true,"systemVariable":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"会话上下文消息列表","enable":true,"name":"CHAT_CONTEXT","require":true,"systemVariable":true}]},"created":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","deleted":false,"description":"Agent Variable","exceptionOut":0,"id":357315,"modified":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","name":"Variable","spaceId":53260111,"targetId":0,"tenantId":1,"type":"Variable"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"hooks":[]},"created":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","deleted":false,"description":"Hook Binding","exceptionOut":0,"icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/logo/hook/Hook","id":357316,"modified":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","name":"Hook","spaceId":53260111,"targetId":-1,"tenantId":1,"type":"Hook"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"eventConfigs":[]},"created":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","deleted":false,"description":"Event Binding","exceptionOut":0,"icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/logo/event/Event+Binding","id":357317,"modified":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","name":"Event Binding","spaceId":53260111,"targetId":-1,"tenantId":1,"type":"Event"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"subAgents":[]},"created":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","deleted":false,"description":"SubAgent","exceptionOut":0,"icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/logo/subagent/SubAgent","id":357318,"modified":"2026-09-18 11:06:54","name":"SubAgent","spaceId":53260111,"targetId":-1,"tenantId":1,"type":"SubAgent"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"async":0,"asyncReplyContent":"已经开始为您处理，请耐心等待运行结果","defaultSelected":0,"inputArgBindConfigs":[{"bindValue":"guide","bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.；可选范围：guide,schema","enable":true,"key":"format","name":"format","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValue":"basic","bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.；可选范围：basic,dashboard,form,all","enable":true,"key":"profile","name":"profile","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"invokeType":"ON_DEMAND","outputArgBindConfigs":[],"toolName":"nuwax_get_openui_reference"},"created":"2026-09-19 10:49:40","deleted":false,"description":"Get the authoritative OpenUI Lang contract before creating a complex Nuwax UI. Use format=guide for syntax, component signatures, and examples; use format=schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema. Use this instead of guessing syntax or searching local package files. Choose dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs, basic for cards/content, and all only as a fallback.","exceptionOut":0,"groupDescription":"生成结构化UI","groupName":"UI生成","icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/f/s3/icon/20260919/73a88477e8ca43cd9cbd55eabc142f49.svg","id":358372,"modified":"2026-09-19 10:49:40","name":"nuwax_get_openui_reference","spaceId":53260111,"targetConfig":{"category":"Other","created":"2026-09-19 10:47:49","creator":{"userId":1784607151,"userName":"雷原豪"},"creatorId":1784607151,"deployStatus":"Deployed","deployed":"2026-09-20 08:53:53","deployedConfig":{"prompts":[{"description":"Load the authoritative DSL syntax, component schema, and examples before creating a Nuwax visual interface.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","key":"profile","name":"profile","require":true}],"name":"nuwax_openui_authoring"}],"resources":[],"serverConfig":"{\"mcpServers\":{\"nuwax-openui\":{\"command\":\"npx\",\"args\":[\"-y\",\"@nuwax-ai/openui-mcp@0.3.12\"],\"env\":{}}}}","tools":[{"description":"Get the authoritative OpenUI Lang contract before creating a complex Nuwax UI. Use format=guide for syntax, component signatures, and examples; use format=schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema. Use this instead of guessing syntax or searching local package files. Choose dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs, basic for cards/content, and all only as a fallback.","inputArgs":[{"bindValue":"guide","dataType":"String","description":"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.","enums":["guide","schema"],"key":"format","name":"format","require":false},{"bindValue":"basic","dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","enums":["basic","dashboard","form","all"],"key":"profile","name":"profile","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"format\":{\"default\":\"guide\",\"description\":\"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.\",\"enum\":[\"guide\",\"schema\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"profile\":{\"default\":\"basic\",\"description\":\"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.\",\"enum\":[\"basic\",\"dashboard\",\"form\",\"all\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_reference"}]},"description":"生成结构化UI","icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/f/s3/icon/20260919/73a88477e8ca43cd9cbd55eabc142f49.svg","id":18267,"installType":"NPX","mcpConfig":{"prompts":[{"description":"Load the authoritative DSL syntax, component schema, and examples before creating a Nuwax visual interface.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","key":"profile","name":"profile","require":true}],"name":"nuwax_openui_authoring"}],"resources":[],"serverConfig":"{\"mcpServers\":{\"nuwax-openui\":{\"command\":\"npx\",\"args\":[\"-y\",\"@nuwax-ai/openui-mcp@0.3.12\"],\"env\":{}}}}","tools":[{"description":"Get the authoritative OpenUI Lang contract before creating a complex Nuwax UI. Use format=guide for syntax, component signatures, and examples; use format=schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema. Use this instead of guessing syntax or searching local package files. Choose dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs, basic for cards/content, and all only as a fallback.","inputArgs":[{"bindValue":"guide","dataType":"String","description":"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.","enums":["guide","schema"],"key":"format","name":"format","require":false},{"bindValue":"basic","dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","enums":["basic","dashboard","form","all"],"key":"profile","name":"profile","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"format\":{\"default\":\"guide\",\"description\":\"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.\",\"enum\":[\"guide\",\"schema\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"profile\":{\"default\":\"basic\",\"description\":\"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.\",\"enum\":[\"basic\",\"dashboard\",\"form\",\"all\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_reference"},{"description":"How to update an existing OpenUI artifact. Call this when the user asks to modify, change title, edit, or update a *.openui.json OpenUI UI. Explains that *.openui.json is the dedicated OpenUI Lang data source, how to reuse artifactId with nuwax_render_openui (recommended), or how to edit the file directly while keeping document.digest valid.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"general","dataType":"String","description":"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.","enums":["title","source","presentation","general"],"key":"intent","name":"intent","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"intent\":{\"default\":\"general\",\"description\":\"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.\",\"enum\":[\"title\",\"source\",\"presentation\",\"general\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_update_guide"},{"description":"## Tool Boundary (CRITICAL)\n\n- nuwax_render_openui and nuwax_ask_question are separate tools; nuwax_render_openui is not an alias for nuwax_ask_question.\n- Visibility: without a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result the user sees NO UI (neither inline nor sidecar). nuwax_get_openui_update_guide / hand-editing `*.openui.json` do not open conversation UI. Never claim created/opened/auto-opened until the tool result is in hand.\n- Route by intent, not by keyword: use nuwax_render_openui whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface for structured information (dashboards, KPI cards, charts, tables, reports, forms, status panels), regardless of wording or language. Do NOT use it for multi-page apps/sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything needing arbitrary JS / external scripts / raw HTML—those belong to ordinary code/files. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（看板/指标卡/图表/表格/报表/表单/状态页）一律走本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需要任意 JS 的场景不要用 OpenUI，直接写普通代码。\n- Never substitute nuwax_ask_question when the user asks to render, show, preview, demonstrate, or update OpenUI. Load the OpenUI reference, author openui-lang, then call nuwax_render_openui.\n- nuwax_ask_question is only for a blocking clarification or decision that the Agent must receive before it can continue. Its inline/modal/wizard schema is not OpenUI Lang and must never be passed to nuwax_render_openui.\n- Do NOT produce UI through ANY code-generation or file-writing path: no bare HTML/CSS/JS files (`*.html`), no SVG/PNG chart files, and no frontend/dataviz/charting skills or tools (such as frontend-design, dataviz, or any skill that generates web pages, charts, or visualization code). 裸 HTML、图片/SVG 图表、以及任何前端 / 数据可视化 / 图表类 skill 的产出都无法在 Host inline/sidecar 中渲染，只有 nuwax_render_openui 写入的 `*.openui.json` 才是 Host 可渲染的协议。用户意图只要是\"单个自包含的可视化界面\"，一律走 nuwax_render_openui，不要写 `*.html`。\n- OpenUI Lang durable data source extension is ALWAYS `*.openui.json` (canonical path: `data/{artifactId}.openui.json`). Do not invent bare `.openui` or other suffixes as the OpenUI data source.\n- When the user asks to modify an existing OpenUI UI or `*.openui.json` file, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide first, then update via nuwax_render_openui (reuse artifactId) or by editing the `.openui.json` while keeping the file contract (including document.digest).\n\nCreate or update a durable OpenUI artifact in the active project. This is the ONLY tool that publishes Host UI—you MUST call it (do not only draft source in chat). Decide by intent, not by keyword: use this tool whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface that presents or collects structured information—KPI cards, charts, tables, dashboards, reports, forms, status panels—regardless of wording or language and even if no chart/component type is named. Do NOT use this tool for multi-page apps or sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything that needs arbitrary JavaScript / external scripts / raw HTML—write ordinary code/files for those instead. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（指标卡/图表/表格/看板/报表/表单/状态页）一律用本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需任意 JS 的场景请直接写普通代码，不要套本工具。Never satisfy a \"self-contained visual interface\" intent by writing bare *.html / *.svg / image files or by using any frontend, dataviz, or charting code-generation skill (such as frontend-design or dataviz)—those outputs cannot be rendered by the Host. The tool writes data/{artifactId}.openui.json (the dedicated *.openui.json OpenUI Lang data source) and returns a lightweight reference. Reuse artifactId to update an existing UI. Do not invent bare .openui paths. OpenUI Lang is assignment-based and is NEVER XML/HTML/JSX: start with root = Stack(...), use positional arguments, and reference every defined variable (orphaned names like unused usersData are rejected). For complex UI or uncertain component signatures, call nuwax_get_openui_reference first. Before modifying an existing artifact, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide. Invalid source fails this call with actionable errors—fix and retry this tool (no separate validate step). Reactive filters must handle empty initial bindings, and dynamic pie/radial charts must guard zero totals. Use inline for compact conversation UI; use sidecar with autoOpen: true when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience.\nAuthor document.source as compact single-line statements with no space/tab padding for alignment (padding bloats the payload past the 100000-char source limit and the call fails JSON parsing). The Host shows UI ONLY after a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result (returning nuwax.openui-ref). NEVER tell the user the UI was created/opened/auto-opened until that tool result arrives—planning, drafting source, or quoting this example is NOT enough. Choose presentation.mode by intent: inline for compact in-chat UI (default example below); use sidecar with autoOpen: true only when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience—copy presentation:{\"mode\":\"sidecar\",\"autoOpen\":true}. Example: {\"schemaVersion\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"title\":\"销售数据看板\",\"presentation\":{\"mode\":\"inline\"},\"document\":{\"language\":\"openui-lang\",\"specVersion\":\"0.5\",\"source\":\"root = Stack([kpiRow, salesChart], \\\"column\\\", \\\"l\\\")\\nkpiRow = Stack([revenueCard, ordersCard], \\\"row\\\", \\\"m\\\")\\nrevenueCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"总营收\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"¥1,286,500\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +12.3%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nordersCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"订单数\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"8,642\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +8.7%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nsalesChart = BarChart(products.product, [Series(\\\"销量\\\", products.sales)])\\nproducts = [{product: \\\"智能手表\\\", sales: 1240}, {product: \\\"无线耳机\\\", sales: 980}, {product: \\\"手机壳\\\", sales: 860}, {product: \\\"充电宝\\\", sales: 720}, {product: \\\"蓝牙音箱\\\", sales: 650}]\"},\"bindings\":{\"tools\":[]},\"fallback\":{\"markdown\":\"\"}}","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"{tools=[]}","dataType":"Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.","key":"bindings","name":"bindings","require":false,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"","key":"tools","name":"tools","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["query","mutation"],"key":"access","name":"access","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"serverId","name":"serverId","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"toolName","name":"toolName","require":true}]}]},{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.","key":"customComponents","name":"customComponents","require":false,"subArgs":[]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"document","name":"document","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"openui-lang\".","key":"language","name":"language","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\ntitle = TextContent(\"Ready\", \"large-heavy\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).","key":"source","name":"source","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"0.5\".","key":"specVersion","name":"specVersion","require":true}]},{"bindValue":"{markdown=}","dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"fallback","name":"fallback","require":false,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"","dataType":"String","description":"","key":"markdown","name":"markdown","require":false}]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"presentation","name":"presentation","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"false","dataType":"Boolean","description":"When true with mode \"sidecar\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience. Ignored for inline.","key":"autoOpen","name":"autoOpen","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.","enums":["compact","normal"],"key":"density","name":"density","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).","enums":["inline","sidecar"],"key":"mode","name":"mode","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["compact","normal","wide"],"key":"preferredWidth","name":"preferredWidth","require":false}]},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.","key":"schemaVersion","name":"schemaVersion","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Visible UI title.","key":"title","name":"title","require":true}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"bindings\":{\"default\":{\"tools\":[]},\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.\",\"properties\":{\"tools\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"access\":{\"enum\":[\"query\",\"mutation\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"serverId\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"toolName\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"serverId\",\"toolName\",\"access\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"tools\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"customComponents\":{\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.\",\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":{},\"propertyNames\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"},\"document\":{\"properties\":{\"language\":{\"const\":\"openui-lang\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"openui-lang\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source\":{\"description\":\"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\\\ntitle = TextContent(\\\"Ready\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).\",\"maxLength\":100000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"specVersion\":{\"const\":\"0.5\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"0.5\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"language\",\"specVersion\",\"source\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"fallback\":{\"default\":{\"markdown\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"markdown\":{\"default\":\"\",\"maxLength\":20000,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"presentation\":{\"properties\":{\"autoOpen\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"When true with mode \\\"sidecar\\\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience. Ignored for inline.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"density\":{\"description\":\"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.\",\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"mode\":{\"description\":\"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).\",\"enum\":[\"inline\",\"sidecar\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"preferredWidth\":{\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\",\"wide\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"mode\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"schemaVersion\":{\"const\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"description\":\"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"Visible UI title.\",\"maxLength\":160,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"schemaVersion\",\"title\",\"presentation\",\"document\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_render_openui"}]},"modified":"2026-09-20 08:53:52","name":"UI生成","platformMcp":false,"serverName":"UI生成","spaceId":53260111},"targetId":18267,"tenantId":1,"type":"Mcp"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"async":0,"asyncReplyContent":"已经开始为您处理，请耐心等待运行结果","defaultSelected":0,"inputArgBindConfigs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.","enable":true,"key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValue":"general","bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.；可选范围：title,source,presentation,general","enable":true,"key":"intent","name":"intent","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"invokeType":"ON_DEMAND","outputArgBindConfigs":[],"toolName":"nuwax_get_openui_update_guide"},"created":"2026-09-19 10:49:41","deleted":false,"description":"How to update an existing OpenUI artifact. Call this when the user asks to modify, change title, edit, or update a *.openui.json OpenUI UI. Explains that *.openui.json is the dedicated OpenUI Lang data source, how to reuse artifactId with nuwax_render_openui (recommended), or how to edit the file directly while keeping document.digest valid.","exceptionOut":0,"groupDescription":"生成结构化UI","groupName":"UI生成","icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/f/s3/icon/20260919/73a88477e8ca43cd9cbd55eabc142f49.svg","id":358373,"modified":"2026-09-19 10:49:41","name":"nuwax_get_openui_update_guide","spaceId":53260111,"targetConfig":{"category":"Other","created":"2026-09-19 10:47:49","creator":{"userId":1784607151,"userName":"雷原豪"},"creatorId":1784607151,"deployStatus":"Deployed","deployed":"2026-09-20 08:53:53","deployedConfig":{"prompts":[{"description":"Load the authoritative DSL syntax, component schema, and examples before creating a Nuwax visual interface.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","key":"profile","name":"profile","require":true}],"name":"nuwax_openui_authoring"}],"resources":[],"serverConfig":"{\"mcpServers\":{\"nuwax-openui\":{\"command\":\"npx\",\"args\":[\"-y\",\"@nuwax-ai/openui-mcp@0.3.12\"],\"env\":{}}}}","tools":[{"description":"How to update an existing OpenUI artifact. Call this when the user asks to modify, change title, edit, or update a *.openui.json OpenUI UI. Explains that *.openui.json is the dedicated OpenUI Lang data source, how to reuse artifactId with nuwax_render_openui (recommended), or how to edit the file directly while keeping document.digest valid.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"general","dataType":"String","description":"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.","enums":["title","source","presentation","general"],"key":"intent","name":"intent","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"intent\":{\"default\":\"general\",\"description\":\"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.\",\"enum\":[\"title\",\"source\",\"presentation\",\"general\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_update_guide"}]},"description":"生成结构化UI","icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/f/s3/icon/20260919/73a88477e8ca43cd9cbd55eabc142f49.svg","id":18267,"installType":"NPX","mcpConfig":{"prompts":[{"description":"Load the authoritative DSL syntax, component schema, and examples before creating a Nuwax visual interface.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","key":"profile","name":"profile","require":true}],"name":"nuwax_openui_authoring"}],"resources":[],"serverConfig":"{\"mcpServers\":{\"nuwax-openui\":{\"command\":\"npx\",\"args\":[\"-y\",\"@nuwax-ai/openui-mcp@0.3.12\"],\"env\":{}}}}","tools":[{"description":"Get the authoritative OpenUI Lang contract before creating a complex Nuwax UI. Use format=guide for syntax, component signatures, and examples; use format=schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema. Use this instead of guessing syntax or searching local package files. Choose dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs, basic for cards/content, and all only as a fallback.","inputArgs":[{"bindValue":"guide","dataType":"String","description":"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.","enums":["guide","schema"],"key":"format","name":"format","require":false},{"bindValue":"basic","dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","enums":["basic","dashboard","form","all"],"key":"profile","name":"profile","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"format\":{\"default\":\"guide\",\"description\":\"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.\",\"enum\":[\"guide\",\"schema\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"profile\":{\"default\":\"basic\",\"description\":\"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.\",\"enum\":[\"basic\",\"dashboard\",\"form\",\"all\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_reference"},{"description":"How to update an existing OpenUI artifact. Call this when the user asks to modify, change title, edit, or update a *.openui.json OpenUI UI. Explains that *.openui.json is the dedicated OpenUI Lang data source, how to reuse artifactId with nuwax_render_openui (recommended), or how to edit the file directly while keeping document.digest valid.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"general","dataType":"String","description":"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.","enums":["title","source","presentation","general"],"key":"intent","name":"intent","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"intent\":{\"default\":\"general\",\"description\":\"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.\",\"enum\":[\"title\",\"source\",\"presentation\",\"general\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_update_guide"},{"description":"## Tool Boundary (CRITICAL)\n\n- nuwax_render_openui and nuwax_ask_question are separate tools; nuwax_render_openui is not an alias for nuwax_ask_question.\n- Visibility: without a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result the user sees NO UI (neither inline nor sidecar). nuwax_get_openui_update_guide / hand-editing `*.openui.json` do not open conversation UI. Never claim created/opened/auto-opened until the tool result is in hand.\n- Route by intent, not by keyword: use nuwax_render_openui whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface for structured information (dashboards, KPI cards, charts, tables, reports, forms, status panels), regardless of wording or language. Do NOT use it for multi-page apps/sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything needing arbitrary JS / external scripts / raw HTML—those belong to ordinary code/files. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（看板/指标卡/图表/表格/报表/表单/状态页）一律走本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需要任意 JS 的场景不要用 OpenUI，直接写普通代码。\n- Never substitute nuwax_ask_question when the user asks to render, show, preview, demonstrate, or update OpenUI. Load the OpenUI reference, author openui-lang, then call nuwax_render_openui.\n- nuwax_ask_question is only for a blocking clarification or decision that the Agent must receive before it can continue. Its inline/modal/wizard schema is not OpenUI Lang and must never be passed to nuwax_render_openui.\n- Do NOT produce UI through ANY code-generation or file-writing path: no bare HTML/CSS/JS files (`*.html`), no SVG/PNG chart files, and no frontend/dataviz/charting skills or tools (such as frontend-design, dataviz, or any skill that generates web pages, charts, or visualization code). 裸 HTML、图片/SVG 图表、以及任何前端 / 数据可视化 / 图表类 skill 的产出都无法在 Host inline/sidecar 中渲染，只有 nuwax_render_openui 写入的 `*.openui.json` 才是 Host 可渲染的协议。用户意图只要是\"单个自包含的可视化界面\"，一律走 nuwax_render_openui，不要写 `*.html`。\n- OpenUI Lang durable data source extension is ALWAYS `*.openui.json` (canonical path: `data/{artifactId}.openui.json`). Do not invent bare `.openui` or other suffixes as the OpenUI data source.\n- When the user asks to modify an existing OpenUI UI or `*.openui.json` file, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide first, then update via nuwax_render_openui (reuse artifactId) or by editing the `.openui.json` while keeping the file contract (including document.digest).\n\nCreate or update a durable OpenUI artifact in the active project. This is the ONLY tool that publishes Host UI—you MUST call it (do not only draft source in chat). Decide by intent, not by keyword: use this tool whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface that presents or collects structured information—KPI cards, charts, tables, dashboards, reports, forms, status panels—regardless of wording or language and even if no chart/component type is named. Do NOT use this tool for multi-page apps or sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything that needs arbitrary JavaScript / external scripts / raw HTML—write ordinary code/files for those instead. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（指标卡/图表/表格/看板/报表/表单/状态页）一律用本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需任意 JS 的场景请直接写普通代码，不要套本工具。Never satisfy a \"self-contained visual interface\" intent by writing bare *.html / *.svg / image files or by using any frontend, dataviz, or charting code-generation skill (such as frontend-design or dataviz)—those outputs cannot be rendered by the Host. The tool writes data/{artifactId}.openui.json (the dedicated *.openui.json OpenUI Lang data source) and returns a lightweight reference. Reuse artifactId to update an existing UI. Do not invent bare .openui paths. OpenUI Lang is assignment-based and is NEVER XML/HTML/JSX: start with root = Stack(...), use positional arguments, and reference every defined variable (orphaned names like unused usersData are rejected). For complex UI or uncertain component signatures, call nuwax_get_openui_reference first. Before modifying an existing artifact, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide. Invalid source fails this call with actionable errors—fix and retry this tool (no separate validate step). Reactive filters must handle empty initial bindings, and dynamic pie/radial charts must guard zero totals. Use inline for compact conversation UI; use sidecar with autoOpen: true when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience.\nAuthor document.source as compact single-line statements with no space/tab padding for alignment (padding bloats the payload past the 100000-char source limit and the call fails JSON parsing). The Host shows UI ONLY after a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result (returning nuwax.openui-ref). NEVER tell the user the UI was created/opened/auto-opened until that tool result arrives—planning, drafting source, or quoting this example is NOT enough. Choose presentation.mode by intent: inline for compact in-chat UI (default example below); use sidecar with autoOpen: true only when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience—copy presentation:{\"mode\":\"sidecar\",\"autoOpen\":true}. Example: {\"schemaVersion\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"title\":\"销售数据看板\",\"presentation\":{\"mode\":\"inline\"},\"document\":{\"language\":\"openui-lang\",\"specVersion\":\"0.5\",\"source\":\"root = Stack([kpiRow, salesChart], \\\"column\\\", \\\"l\\\")\\nkpiRow = Stack([revenueCard, ordersCard], \\\"row\\\", \\\"m\\\")\\nrevenueCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"总营收\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"¥1,286,500\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +12.3%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nordersCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"订单数\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"8,642\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +8.7%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nsalesChart = BarChart(products.product, [Series(\\\"销量\\\", products.sales)])\\nproducts = [{product: \\\"智能手表\\\", sales: 1240}, {product: \\\"无线耳机\\\", sales: 980}, {product: \\\"手机壳\\\", sales: 860}, {product: \\\"充电宝\\\", sales: 720}, {product: \\\"蓝牙音箱\\\", sales: 650}]\"},\"bindings\":{\"tools\":[]},\"fallback\":{\"markdown\":\"\"}}","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"{tools=[]}","dataType":"Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.","key":"bindings","name":"bindings","require":false,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"","key":"tools","name":"tools","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["query","mutation"],"key":"access","name":"access","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"serverId","name":"serverId","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"toolName","name":"toolName","require":true}]}]},{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.","key":"customComponents","name":"customComponents","require":false,"subArgs":[]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"document","name":"document","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"openui-lang\".","key":"language","name":"language","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\ntitle = TextContent(\"Ready\", \"large-heavy\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).","key":"source","name":"source","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"0.5\".","key":"specVersion","name":"specVersion","require":true}]},{"bindValue":"{markdown=}","dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"fallback","name":"fallback","require":false,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"","dataType":"String","description":"","key":"markdown","name":"markdown","require":false}]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"presentation","name":"presentation","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"false","dataType":"Boolean","description":"When true with mode \"sidecar\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience. Ignored for inline.","key":"autoOpen","name":"autoOpen","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.","enums":["compact","normal"],"key":"density","name":"density","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).","enums":["inline","sidecar"],"key":"mode","name":"mode","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["compact","normal","wide"],"key":"preferredWidth","name":"preferredWidth","require":false}]},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.","key":"schemaVersion","name":"schemaVersion","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Visible UI title.","key":"title","name":"title","require":true}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"bindings\":{\"default\":{\"tools\":[]},\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.\",\"properties\":{\"tools\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"access\":{\"enum\":[\"query\",\"mutation\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"serverId\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"toolName\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"serverId\",\"toolName\",\"access\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"tools\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"customComponents\":{\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.\",\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":{},\"propertyNames\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"},\"document\":{\"properties\":{\"language\":{\"const\":\"openui-lang\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"openui-lang\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source\":{\"description\":\"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\\\ntitle = TextContent(\\\"Ready\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).\",\"maxLength\":100000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"specVersion\":{\"const\":\"0.5\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"0.5\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"language\",\"specVersion\",\"source\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"fallback\":{\"default\":{\"markdown\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"markdown\":{\"default\":\"\",\"maxLength\":20000,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"presentation\":{\"properties\":{\"autoOpen\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"When true with mode \\\"sidecar\\\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience. Ignored for inline.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"density\":{\"description\":\"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.\",\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"mode\":{\"description\":\"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).\",\"enum\":[\"inline\",\"sidecar\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"preferredWidth\":{\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\",\"wide\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"mode\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"schemaVersion\":{\"const\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"description\":\"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"Visible UI title.\",\"maxLength\":160,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"schemaVersion\",\"title\",\"presentation\",\"document\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_render_openui"}]},"modified":"2026-09-20 08:53:52","name":"UI生成","platformMcp":false,"serverName":"UI生成","spaceId":53260111},"targetId":18267,"tenantId":1,"type":"Mcp"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"async":0,"asyncReplyContent":"已经开始为您处理，请耐心等待运行结果","defaultSelected":0,"inputArgBindConfigs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.","enable":true,"key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValue":"{tools=[]}","bindValueType":"Input","children":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"；可选范围：query,mutation","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.access","name":"access","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.serverId","name":"serverId","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.toolName","name":"toolName","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools","name":"tools","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"；可选范围：query,mutation","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.access","name":"access","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.serverId","name":"serverId","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.toolName","name":"toolName","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"systemVariable":false}],"dataType":"Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.","enable":true,"key":"bindings","name":"bindings","require":false,"subArgs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"；可选范围：query,mutation","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.access","name":"access","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.serverId","name":"serverId","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.toolName","name":"toolName","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools","name":"tools","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"；可选范围：query,mutation","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.access","name":"access","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.serverId","name":"serverId","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"bindings.tools.toolName","name":"toolName","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"systemVariable":false}],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.","enable":true,"key":"customComponents","name":"customComponents","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"openui-lang\".","enable":true,"key":"document.language","name":"language","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\ntitle = TextContent(\"Ready\", \"large-heavy\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).","enable":true,"key":"document.source","name":"source","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"0.5\".","enable":true,"key":"document.specVersion","name":"specVersion","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"dataType":"Object","description":"","enable":true,"key":"document","name":"document","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"openui-lang\".","enable":true,"key":"document.language","name":"language","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\ntitle = TextContent(\"Ready\", \"large-heavy\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).","enable":true,"key":"document.source","name":"source","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"0.5\".","enable":true,"key":"document.specVersion","name":"specVersion","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValue":"{markdown=}","bindValueType":"Input","children":[{"bindValue":"","bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"fallback.markdown","name":"markdown","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"dataType":"Object","description":"","enable":true,"key":"fallback","name":"fallback","require":false,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"","bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"","enable":true,"key":"fallback.markdown","name":"markdown","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[{"bindValue":"false","bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"Boolean","description":"When true with mode \"sidecar\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience. Ignored for inline.","enable":true,"key":"presentation.autoOpen","name":"autoOpen","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.；可选范围：compact,normal","enable":true,"key":"presentation.density","name":"density","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).；可选范围：inline,sidecar","enable":true,"key":"presentation.mode","name":"mode","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"；可选范围：compact,normal,wide","enable":true,"key":"presentation.preferredWidth","name":"preferredWidth","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"dataType":"Object","description":"","enable":true,"key":"presentation","name":"presentation","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"false","bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"Boolean","description":"When true with mode \"sidecar\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience. Ignored for inline.","enable":true,"key":"presentation.autoOpen","name":"autoOpen","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.；可选范围：compact,normal","enable":true,"key":"presentation.density","name":"density","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).；可选范围：inline,sidecar","enable":true,"key":"presentation.mode","name":"mode","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"；可选范围：compact,normal,wide","enable":true,"key":"presentation.preferredWidth","name":"preferredWidth","require":false,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.","enable":true,"key":"schemaVersion","name":"schemaVersion","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false},{"bindValueType":"Input","children":[],"dataType":"String","description":"Visible UI title.","enable":true,"key":"title","name":"title","require":true,"subArgs":[],"systemVariable":false}],"invokeType":"ON_DEMAND","outputArgBindConfigs":[],"toolName":"nuwax_render_openui"},"created":"2026-09-19 10:49:43","deleted":false,"description":"## Tool Boundary (CRITICAL)\n\n- nuwax_render_openui and nuwax_ask_question are separate tools; nuwax_render_openui is not an alias for nuwax_ask_question.\n- Visibility: without a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result the user sees NO UI (neither inline nor sidecar). nuwax_get_openui_update_guide / hand-editing `*.openui.json` do not open conversation UI. Never claim created/opened/auto-opened until the tool result is in hand.\n- Route by intent, not by keyword: use nuwax_render_openui whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface for structured information (dashboards, KPI cards, charts, tables, reports, forms, status panels), regardless of wording or language. Do NOT use it for multi-page apps/sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything needing arbitrary JS / external scripts / raw HTML—those belong to ordinary code/files. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（看板/指标卡/图表/表格/报表/表单/状态页）一律走本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需要任意 JS 的场景不要用 OpenUI，直接写普通代码。\n- Never substitute nuwax_ask_question when the user asks to render, show, preview, demonstrate, or update OpenUI. Load the OpenUI reference, author openui-lang, then call nuwax_render_openui.\n- nuwax_ask_question is only for a blocking clarification or decision that the Agent must receive before it can continue. Its inline/modal/wizard schema is not OpenUI Lang and must never be passed to nuwax_render_openui.\n- Do NOT produce UI through ANY code-generation or file-writing path: no bare HTML/CSS/JS files (`*.html`), no SVG/PNG chart files, and no frontend/dataviz/charting skills or tools (such as frontend-design, dataviz, or any skill that generates web pages, charts, or visualization code). 裸 HTML、图片/SVG 图表、以及任何前端 / 数据可视化 / 图表类 skill 的产出都无法在 Host inline/sidecar 中渲染，只有 nuwax_render_openui 写入的 `*.openui.json` 才是 Host 可渲染的协议。用户意图只要是\"单个自包含的可视化界面\"，一律走 nuwax_render_openui，不要写 `*.html`。\n- OpenUI Lang durable data source extension is ALWAYS `*.openui.json` (canonical path: `data/{artifactId}.openui.json`). Do not invent bare `.openui` or other suffixes as the OpenUI data source.\n- When the user asks to modify an existing OpenUI UI or `*.openui.json` file, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide first, then update via nuwax_render_openui (reuse artifactId) or by editing the `.openui.json` while keeping the file contract (including document.digest).\n\nCreate or update a durable OpenUI artifact in the active project. This is the ONLY tool that publishes Host UI—you MUST call it (do not only draft source in chat). Decide by intent, not by keyword: use this tool whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface that presents or collects structured information—KPI cards, charts, tables, dashboards, reports, forms, status panels—regardless of wording or language and even if no chart/component type is named. Do NOT use this tool for multi-page apps or sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything that needs arbitrary JavaScript / external scripts / raw HTML—write ordinary code/files for those instead. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（指标卡/图表/表格/看板/报表/表单/状态页）一律用本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需任意 JS 的场景请直接写普通代码，不要套本工具。Never satisfy a \"self-contained visual interface\" intent by writing bare *.html / *.svg / image files or by using any frontend, dataviz, or charting code-generation skill (such as frontend-design or dataviz)—those outputs cannot be rendered by the Host. The tool writes data/{artifactId}.openui.json (the dedicated *.openui.json OpenUI Lang data source) and returns a lightweight reference. Reuse artifactId to update an existing UI. Do not invent bare .openui paths. OpenUI Lang is assignment-based and is NEVER XML/HTML/JSX: start with root = Stack(...), use positional arguments, and reference every defined variable (orphaned names like unused usersData are rejected). For complex UI or uncertain component signatures, call nuwax_get_openui_reference first. Before modifying an existing artifact, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide. Invalid source fails this call with actionable errors—fix and retry this tool (no separate validate step). Reactive filters must handle empty initial bindings, and dynamic pie/radial charts must guard zero totals. Use inline for compact conversation UI; use sidecar with autoOpen: true when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience.\nAuthor document.source as compact single-line statements with no space/tab padding for alignment (padding bloats the payload past the 100000-char source limit and the call fails JSON parsing). The Host shows UI ONLY after a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result (returning nuwax.openui-ref). NEVER tell the user the UI was created/opened/auto-opened until that tool result arrives—planning, drafting source, or quoting this example is NOT enough. Choose presentation.mode by intent: inline for compact in-chat UI (default example below); use sidecar with autoOpen: true only when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience—copy presentation:{\"mode\":\"sidecar\",\"autoOpen\":true}. Example: {\"schemaVersion\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"title\":\"销售数据看板\",\"presentation\":{\"mode\":\"inline\"},\"document\":{\"language\":\"openui-lang\",\"specVersion\":\"0.5\",\"source\":\"root = Stack([kpiRow, salesChart], \\\"column\\\", \\\"l\\\")\\nkpiRow = Stack([revenueCard, ordersCard], \\\"row\\\", \\\"m\\\")\\nrevenueCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"总营收\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"¥1,286,500\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +12.3%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nordersCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"订单数\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"8,642\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +8.7%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nsalesChart = BarChart(products.product, [Series(\\\"销量\\\", products.sales)])\\nproducts = [{product: \\\"智能手表\\\", sales: 1240}, {product: \\\"无线耳机\\\", sales: 980}, {product: \\\"手机壳\\\", sales: 860}, {product: \\\"充电宝\\\", sales: 720}, {product: \\\"蓝牙音箱\\\", sales: 650}]\"},\"bindings\":{\"tools\":[]},\"fallback\":{\"markdown\":\"\"}}","exceptionOut":0,"groupDescription":"生成结构化UI","groupName":"UI生成","icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/f/s3/icon/20260919/73a88477e8ca43cd9cbd55eabc142f49.svg","id":358374,"modified":"2026-09-19 10:49:43","name":"nuwax_render_openui","spaceId":53260111,"targetConfig":{"category":"Other","created":"2026-09-19 10:47:49","creator":{"userId":1784607151,"userName":"雷原豪"},"creatorId":1784607151,"deployStatus":"Deployed","deployed":"2026-09-20 08:53:53","deployedConfig":{"prompts":[{"description":"Load the authoritative DSL syntax, component schema, and examples before creating a Nuwax visual interface.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","key":"profile","name":"profile","require":true}],"name":"nuwax_openui_authoring"}],"resources":[],"serverConfig":"{\"mcpServers\":{\"nuwax-openui\":{\"command\":\"npx\",\"args\":[\"-y\",\"@nuwax-ai/openui-mcp@0.3.12\"],\"env\":{}}}}","tools":[{"description":"## Tool Boundary (CRITICAL)\n\n- nuwax_render_openui and nuwax_ask_question are separate tools; nuwax_render_openui is not an alias for nuwax_ask_question.\n- Visibility: without a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result the user sees NO UI (neither inline nor sidecar). nuwax_get_openui_update_guide / hand-editing `*.openui.json` do not open conversation UI. Never claim created/opened/auto-opened until the tool result is in hand.\n- Route by intent, not by keyword: use nuwax_render_openui whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface for structured information (dashboards, KPI cards, charts, tables, reports, forms, status panels), regardless of wording or language. Do NOT use it for multi-page apps/sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything needing arbitrary JS / external scripts / raw HTML—those belong to ordinary code/files. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（看板/指标卡/图表/表格/报表/表单/状态页）一律走本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需要任意 JS 的场景不要用 OpenUI，直接写普通代码。\n- Never substitute nuwax_ask_question when the user asks to render, show, preview, demonstrate, or update OpenUI. Load the OpenUI reference, author openui-lang, then call nuwax_render_openui.\n- nuwax_ask_question is only for a blocking clarification or decision that the Agent must receive before it can continue. Its inline/modal/wizard schema is not OpenUI Lang and must never be passed to nuwax_render_openui.\n- Do NOT produce UI through ANY code-generation or file-writing path: no bare HTML/CSS/JS files (`*.html`), no SVG/PNG chart files, and no frontend/dataviz/charting skills or tools (such as frontend-design, dataviz, or any skill that generates web pages, charts, or visualization code). 裸 HTML、图片/SVG 图表、以及任何前端 / 数据可视化 / 图表类 skill 的产出都无法在 Host inline/sidecar 中渲染，只有 nuwax_render_openui 写入的 `*.openui.json` 才是 Host 可渲染的协议。用户意图只要是\"单个自包含的可视化界面\"，一律走 nuwax_render_openui，不要写 `*.html`。\n- OpenUI Lang durable data source extension is ALWAYS `*.openui.json` (canonical path: `data/{artifactId}.openui.json`). Do not invent bare `.openui` or other suffixes as the OpenUI data source.\n- When the user asks to modify an existing OpenUI UI or `*.openui.json` file, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide first, then update via nuwax_render_openui (reuse artifactId) or by editing the `.openui.json` while keeping the file contract (including document.digest).\n\nCreate or update a durable OpenUI artifact in the active project. This is the ONLY tool that publishes Host UI—you MUST call it (do not only draft source in chat). Decide by intent, not by keyword: use this tool whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface that presents or collects structured information—KPI cards, charts, tables, dashboards, reports, forms, status panels—regardless of wording or language and even if no chart/component type is named. Do NOT use this tool for multi-page apps or sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything that needs arbitrary JavaScript / external scripts / raw HTML—write ordinary code/files for those instead. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（指标卡/图表/表格/看板/报表/表单/状态页）一律用本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需任意 JS 的场景请直接写普通代码，不要套本工具。Never satisfy a \"self-contained visual interface\" intent by writing bare *.html / *.svg / image files or by using any frontend, dataviz, or charting code-generation skill (such as frontend-design or dataviz)—those outputs cannot be rendered by the Host. The tool writes data/{artifactId}.openui.json (the dedicated *.openui.json OpenUI Lang data source) and returns a lightweight reference. Reuse artifactId to update an existing UI. Do not invent bare .openui paths. OpenUI Lang is assignment-based and is NEVER XML/HTML/JSX: start with root = Stack(...), use positional arguments, and reference every defined variable (orphaned names like unused usersData are rejected). For complex UI or uncertain component signatures, call nuwax_get_openui_reference first. Before modifying an existing artifact, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide. Invalid source fails this call with actionable errors—fix and retry this tool (no separate validate step). Reactive filters must handle empty initial bindings, and dynamic pie/radial charts must guard zero totals. Use inline for compact conversation UI; use sidecar with autoOpen: true when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience.\nAuthor document.source as compact single-line statements with no space/tab padding for alignment (padding bloats the payload past the 100000-char source limit and the call fails JSON parsing). The Host shows UI ONLY after a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result (returning nuwax.openui-ref). NEVER tell the user the UI was created/opened/auto-opened until that tool result arrives—planning, drafting source, or quoting this example is NOT enough. Choose presentation.mode by intent: inline for compact in-chat UI (default example below); use sidecar with autoOpen: true only when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience—copy presentation:{\"mode\":\"sidecar\",\"autoOpen\":true}. Example: {\"schemaVersion\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"title\":\"销售数据看板\",\"presentation\":{\"mode\":\"inline\"},\"document\":{\"language\":\"openui-lang\",\"specVersion\":\"0.5\",\"source\":\"root = Stack([kpiRow, salesChart], \\\"column\\\", \\\"l\\\")\\nkpiRow = Stack([revenueCard, ordersCard], \\\"row\\\", \\\"m\\\")\\nrevenueCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"总营收\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"¥1,286,500\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +12.3%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nordersCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"订单数\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"8,642\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +8.7%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nsalesChart = BarChart(products.product, [Series(\\\"销量\\\", products.sales)])\\nproducts = [{product: \\\"智能手表\\\", sales: 1240}, {product: \\\"无线耳机\\\", sales: 980}, {product: \\\"手机壳\\\", sales: 860}, {product: \\\"充电宝\\\", sales: 720}, {product: \\\"蓝牙音箱\\\", sales: 650}]\"},\"bindings\":{\"tools\":[]},\"fallback\":{\"markdown\":\"\"}}","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"{tools=[]}","dataType":"Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.","key":"bindings","name":"bindings","require":false,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"","key":"tools","name":"tools","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["query","mutation"],"key":"access","name":"access","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"serverId","name":"serverId","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"toolName","name":"toolName","require":true}]}]},{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.","key":"customComponents","name":"customComponents","require":false,"subArgs":[]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"document","name":"document","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"openui-lang\".","key":"language","name":"language","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\ntitle = TextContent(\"Ready\", \"large-heavy\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).","key":"source","name":"source","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"0.5\".","key":"specVersion","name":"specVersion","require":true}]},{"bindValue":"{markdown=}","dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"fallback","name":"fallback","require":false,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"","dataType":"String","description":"","key":"markdown","name":"markdown","require":false}]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"presentation","name":"presentation","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"false","dataType":"Boolean","description":"When true with mode \"sidecar\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience. Ignored for inline.","key":"autoOpen","name":"autoOpen","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.","enums":["compact","normal"],"key":"density","name":"density","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).","enums":["inline","sidecar"],"key":"mode","name":"mode","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["compact","normal","wide"],"key":"preferredWidth","name":"preferredWidth","require":false}]},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.","key":"schemaVersion","name":"schemaVersion","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Visible UI title.","key":"title","name":"title","require":true}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"bindings\":{\"default\":{\"tools\":[]},\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.\",\"properties\":{\"tools\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"access\":{\"enum\":[\"query\",\"mutation\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"serverId\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"toolName\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"serverId\",\"toolName\",\"access\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"tools\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"customComponents\":{\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.\",\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":{},\"propertyNames\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"},\"document\":{\"properties\":{\"language\":{\"const\":\"openui-lang\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"openui-lang\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source\":{\"description\":\"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\\\ntitle = TextContent(\\\"Ready\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).\",\"maxLength\":100000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"specVersion\":{\"const\":\"0.5\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"0.5\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"language\",\"specVersion\",\"source\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"fallback\":{\"default\":{\"markdown\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"markdown\":{\"default\":\"\",\"maxLength\":20000,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"presentation\":{\"properties\":{\"autoOpen\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"When true with mode \\\"sidecar\\\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience. Ignored for inline.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"density\":{\"description\":\"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.\",\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"mode\":{\"description\":\"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).\",\"enum\":[\"inline\",\"sidecar\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"preferredWidth\":{\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\",\"wide\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"mode\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"schemaVersion\":{\"const\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"description\":\"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"Visible UI title.\",\"maxLength\":160,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"schemaVersion\",\"title\",\"presentation\",\"document\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_render_openui"}]},"description":"生成结构化UI","icon":"https://agent.nuwax.com/api/f/s3/icon/20260919/73a88477e8ca43cd9cbd55eabc142f49.svg","id":18267,"installType":"NPX","mcpConfig":{"prompts":[{"description":"Load the authoritative DSL syntax, component schema, and examples before creating a Nuwax visual interface.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","key":"profile","name":"profile","require":true}],"name":"nuwax_openui_authoring"}],"resources":[],"serverConfig":"{\"mcpServers\":{\"nuwax-openui\":{\"command\":\"npx\",\"args\":[\"-y\",\"@nuwax-ai/openui-mcp@0.3.12\"],\"env\":{}}}}","tools":[{"description":"Get the authoritative OpenUI Lang contract before creating a complex Nuwax UI. Use format=guide for syntax, component signatures, and examples; use format=schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema. Use this instead of guessing syntax or searching local package files. Choose dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs, basic for cards/content, and all only as a fallback.","inputArgs":[{"bindValue":"guide","dataType":"String","description":"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.","enums":["guide","schema"],"key":"format","name":"format","require":false},{"bindValue":"basic","dataType":"String","description":"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.","enums":["basic","dashboard","form","all"],"key":"profile","name":"profile","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"format\":{\"default\":\"guide\",\"description\":\"Use guide for authoring instructions, component signatures, and examples. Use schema for the complete renderer-generated JSON Schema.\",\"enum\":[\"guide\",\"schema\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"profile\":{\"default\":\"basic\",\"description\":\"Component reference to return: basic for cards/content, dashboard for tables/charts, form for inputs/actions, all only when the other profiles are insufficient.\",\"enum\":[\"basic\",\"dashboard\",\"form\",\"all\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_reference"},{"description":"How to update an existing OpenUI artifact. Call this when the user asks to modify, change title, edit, or update a *.openui.json OpenUI UI. Explains that *.openui.json is the dedicated OpenUI Lang data source, how to reuse artifactId with nuwax_render_openui (recommended), or how to edit the file directly while keeping document.digest valid.","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"general","dataType":"String","description":"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.","enums":["title","source","presentation","general"],"key":"intent","name":"intent","require":false}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional existing artifact UUID from data/{artifactId}.openui.json or a prior nuwax.openui-ref. When set, the guide embeds this ID in the update example.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"intent\":{\"default\":\"general\",\"description\":\"What the user wants to change: title for visible title only, source for OpenUI Lang body, presentation for inline/sidecar, general for any update.\",\"enum\":[\"title\",\"source\",\"presentation\",\"general\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_get_openui_update_guide"},{"description":"## Tool Boundary (CRITICAL)\n\n- nuwax_render_openui and nuwax_ask_question are separate tools; nuwax_render_openui is not an alias for nuwax_ask_question.\n- Visibility: without a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result the user sees NO UI (neither inline nor sidecar). nuwax_get_openui_update_guide / hand-editing `*.openui.json` do not open conversation UI. Never claim created/opened/auto-opened until the tool result is in hand.\n- Route by intent, not by keyword: use nuwax_render_openui whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface for structured information (dashboards, KPI cards, charts, tables, reports, forms, status panels), regardless of wording or language. Do NOT use it for multi-page apps/sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything needing arbitrary JS / external scripts / raw HTML—those belong to ordinary code/files. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（看板/指标卡/图表/表格/报表/表单/状态页）一律走本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需要任意 JS 的场景不要用 OpenUI，直接写普通代码。\n- Never substitute nuwax_ask_question when the user asks to render, show, preview, demonstrate, or update OpenUI. Load the OpenUI reference, author openui-lang, then call nuwax_render_openui.\n- nuwax_ask_question is only for a blocking clarification or decision that the Agent must receive before it can continue. Its inline/modal/wizard schema is not OpenUI Lang and must never be passed to nuwax_render_openui.\n- Do NOT produce UI through ANY code-generation or file-writing path: no bare HTML/CSS/JS files (`*.html`), no SVG/PNG chart files, and no frontend/dataviz/charting skills or tools (such as frontend-design, dataviz, or any skill that generates web pages, charts, or visualization code). 裸 HTML、图片/SVG 图表、以及任何前端 / 数据可视化 / 图表类 skill 的产出都无法在 Host inline/sidecar 中渲染，只有 nuwax_render_openui 写入的 `*.openui.json` 才是 Host 可渲染的协议。用户意图只要是\"单个自包含的可视化界面\"，一律走 nuwax_render_openui，不要写 `*.html`。\n- OpenUI Lang durable data source extension is ALWAYS `*.openui.json` (canonical path: `data/{artifactId}.openui.json`). Do not invent bare `.openui` or other suffixes as the OpenUI data source.\n- When the user asks to modify an existing OpenUI UI or `*.openui.json` file, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide first, then update via nuwax_render_openui (reuse artifactId) or by editing the `.openui.json` while keeping the file contract (including document.digest).\n\nCreate or update a durable OpenUI artifact in the active project. This is the ONLY tool that publishes Host UI—you MUST call it (do not only draft source in chat). Decide by intent, not by keyword: use this tool whenever the user's goal is ONE self-contained interface that presents or collects structured information—KPI cards, charts, tables, dashboards, reports, forms, status panels—regardless of wording or language and even if no chart/component type is named. Do NOT use this tool for multi-page apps or sites, games or highly interactive bespoke experiences, free-form documents, or anything that needs arbitrary JavaScript / external scripts / raw HTML—write ordinary code/files for those instead. 按意图路由：单个自包含的结构化信息界面（指标卡/图表/表格/看板/报表/表单/状态页）一律用本工具；多页应用、游戏/重交互、自由文档、或需任意 JS 的场景请直接写普通代码，不要套本工具。Never satisfy a \"self-contained visual interface\" intent by writing bare *.html / *.svg / image files or by using any frontend, dataviz, or charting code-generation skill (such as frontend-design or dataviz)—those outputs cannot be rendered by the Host. The tool writes data/{artifactId}.openui.json (the dedicated *.openui.json OpenUI Lang data source) and returns a lightweight reference. Reuse artifactId to update an existing UI. Do not invent bare .openui paths. OpenUI Lang is assignment-based and is NEVER XML/HTML/JSX: start with root = Stack(...), use positional arguments, and reference every defined variable (orphaned names like unused usersData are rejected). For complex UI or uncertain component signatures, call nuwax_get_openui_reference first. Before modifying an existing artifact, call nuwax_get_openui_update_guide. Invalid source fails this call with actionable errors—fix and retry this tool (no separate validate step). Reactive filters must handle empty initial bindings, and dynamic pie/radial charts must guard zero totals. Use inline for compact conversation UI; use sidecar with autoOpen: true when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience.\nAuthor document.source as compact single-line statements with no space/tab padding for alignment (padding bloats the payload past the 100000-char source limit and the call fails JSON parsing). The Host shows UI ONLY after a successful nuwax_render_openui tool result (returning nuwax.openui-ref). NEVER tell the user the UI was created/opened/auto-opened until that tool result arrives—planning, drafting source, or quoting this example is NOT enough. Choose presentation.mode by intent: inline for compact in-chat UI (default example below); use sidecar with autoOpen: true only when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience—copy presentation:{\"mode\":\"sidecar\",\"autoOpen\":true}. Example: {\"schemaVersion\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"title\":\"销售数据看板\",\"presentation\":{\"mode\":\"inline\"},\"document\":{\"language\":\"openui-lang\",\"specVersion\":\"0.5\",\"source\":\"root = Stack([kpiRow, salesChart], \\\"column\\\", \\\"l\\\")\\nkpiRow = Stack([revenueCard, ordersCard], \\\"row\\\", \\\"m\\\")\\nrevenueCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"总营收\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"¥1,286,500\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +12.3%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nordersCard = Card([TextContent(\\\"订单数\\\", \\\"small\\\"), TextContent(\\\"8,642\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"), TextContent(\\\"环比 +8.7%\\\", \\\"small\\\")])\\nsalesChart = BarChart(products.product, [Series(\\\"销量\\\", products.sales)])\\nproducts = [{product: \\\"智能手表\\\", sales: 1240}, {product: \\\"无线耳机\\\", sales: 980}, {product: \\\"手机壳\\\", sales: 860}, {product: \\\"充电宝\\\", sales: 720}, {product: \\\"蓝牙音箱\\\", sales: 650}]\"},\"bindings\":{\"tools\":[]},\"fallback\":{\"markdown\":\"\"}}","inputArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.","key":"artifactId","name":"artifactId","require":false},{"bindValue":"{tools=[]}","dataType":"Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.","key":"bindings","name":"bindings","require":false,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"","key":"tools","name":"tools","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["query","mutation"],"key":"access","name":"access","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"serverId","name":"serverId","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","key":"toolName","name":"toolName","require":true}]}]},{"dataType":"Array_Object","description":"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.","key":"customComponents","name":"customComponents","require":false,"subArgs":[]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"document","name":"document","require":true,"subArgs":[{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"openui-lang\".","key":"language","name":"language","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\ntitle = TextContent(\"Ready\", \"large-heavy\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).","key":"source","name":"source","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always the fixed string \"0.5\".","key":"specVersion","name":"specVersion","require":true}]},{"bindValue":"{markdown=}","dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"fallback","name":"fallback","require":false,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"","dataType":"String","description":"","key":"markdown","name":"markdown","require":false}]},{"dataType":"Object","description":"","key":"presentation","name":"presentation","require":true,"subArgs":[{"bindValue":"false","dataType":"Boolean","description":"When true with mode \"sidecar\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience. Ignored for inline.","key":"autoOpen","name":"autoOpen","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.","enums":["compact","normal"],"key":"density","name":"density","require":false},{"dataType":"String","description":"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \"don't put it in the chat bubble\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).","enums":["inline","sidecar"],"key":"mode","name":"mode","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"","enums":["compact","normal","wide"],"key":"preferredWidth","name":"preferredWidth","require":false}]},{"dataType":"String","description":"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.","key":"schemaVersion","name":"schemaVersion","require":true},{"dataType":"String","description":"Visible UI title.","key":"title","name":"title","require":true}],"jsonSchema":"{\"properties\":{\"artifactId\":{\"description\":\"Optional stable artifact UUID. Reusing an existing ID atomically replaces data/{artifactId}.openui.json.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"pattern\":\"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"bindings\":{\"default\":{\"tools\":[]},\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for live MCP-tool data bindings (Query/Mutation). The current runtime does NOT execute tool bindings—leave tools empty.\",\"properties\":{\"tools\":{\"items\":{\"properties\":{\"access\":{\"enum\":[\"query\",\"mutation\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"serverId\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"toolName\":{\"maxLength\":128,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"serverId\",\"toolName\",\"access\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"tools\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"customComponents\":{\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder for future custom-component registration (not yet supported). Leave unset.\",\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":{},\"propertyNames\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":0,\"type\":\"array\"},\"document\":{\"properties\":{\"language\":{\"const\":\"openui-lang\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"openui-lang\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"source\":{\"description\":\"OpenUI Lang assignment syntax, NEVER XML/HTML/JSX. The first line must define root = Stack(...); arguments are positional. Minimal valid example: root = Stack([title])\\\\ntitle = TextContent(\\\"Ready\\\", \\\"large-heavy\\\"). Call nuwax_get_openui_reference before authoring a complex document or whenever a signature is uncertain. Reactive filters must bypass @Filter while their $binding is empty, and dynamic pie/radial charts must show an empty state when their total is zero. Author as compact single-line statements with no space/tab alignment padding (padding is the usual cause of exceeding the 100000-char limit).\",\"maxLength\":100000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"specVersion\":{\"const\":\"0.5\",\"description\":\"Always the fixed string \\\"0.5\\\".\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"language\",\"specVersion\",\"source\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"fallback\":{\"default\":{\"markdown\":\"\"},\"properties\":{\"markdown\":{\"default\":\"\",\"maxLength\":20000,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"},\"presentation\":{\"properties\":{\"autoOpen\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"When true with mode \\\"sidecar\\\", the Host opens the full page automatically on render. Set true whenever the user asks for a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience. Ignored for inline.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"density\":{\"description\":\"Reserved for theme density. Stored on the artifact only; the current runtime ignores it and always renders the compact theme, so there is no visual effect today. Omit for the default.\",\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"mode\":{\"description\":\"Use inline for cards, forms, tables, and compact dashboards in chat. Use sidecar when the user wants a full-screen / standalone page / \\\"don't put it in the chat bubble\\\" experience (pair with autoOpen: true).\",\"enum\":[\"inline\",\"sidecar\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"preferredWidth\":{\"enum\":[\"compact\",\"normal\",\"wide\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"mode\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"schemaVersion\":{\"const\":\"nuwax.openui/v1\",\"description\":\"Always use nuwax.openui/v1.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"title\":{\"description\":\"Visible UI title.\",\"maxLength\":160,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"schemaVersion\",\"title\",\"presentation\",\"document\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","name":"nuwax_render_openui"}]},"modified":"2026-09-20 08:53:52","name":"UI生成","platformMcp":false,"serverName":"UI生成","spaceId":53260111},"targetId":18267,"tenantId":1,"type":"Mcp"},{"agentId":33298480,"bindConfig":{"argBindConfigs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","dataType":"String","description":"input message","enable":true,"key":"input","name":"input","require":false,"systemVariable":false}],"async":0,"asyncReplyContent":"已经开始为您处理，请耐心等待运行结果","cardBindConfig":{"bindCardStyle":"SINGLE","bindLinkUrl":"","cardArgsBindConfigs":[{"bindValue":"","key":"title"},{"bindValue":"","key":"content"},{"bindValue":"","key":"image"}],"cardId":4,"cardKey":"template-1"},"defaultSelected":0,"inputArgBindConfigs":[{"bindValueType":"Input","dataType":"String","description":"input message","enable":true,"key":"input","name":"input","require":false,"systemVariable":false}],"invokeType":"ON_DEMAND","outputArgBindConfigs":[{"bindValue":"62109830.clean_source","bindValueType":"Reference","dataType":"String","enable":true,"key":"clean_source","name":"clean_source","require":false,"systemVariable":false}],"useResultCache":false},"created":"2026-09-19 13:59:09","deleted":false,"description":"基于AI的个性化行程规划工具，智能定制专属旅行路线与日程安排","exceptionOut":0,"icon":"h